/*
  TOTPEnrollmentSection.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 feature view · 0217 · TOTPEnrollmentSection (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native
  TOTPEnrollmentSection resolves (table "TOTPEnrollmentSection") lives here with
  its web t(key, default) English value. These entries fold into the app
  Localizable.xcstrings master catalog at integration time; they are kept in a
  per-surface table so each parallel surface prompt owns its own strings without
  editing the shared catalog.

  The first group is the exact set of keys the web source
  (features/settings/components/TOTPEnrollmentSection.tsx) passes to t(). The
  second group backs the native-only chrome (close / error / retry / freshness)
  the Apple HIG states contract requires.
*/

